      "end_line": 69,
      "raw": "- `windowChromeInteractionZ`\n- `windowChromeInteractionLayer`(읽기 전용 별칭)\n- `requestWindowMove()`\n- `requestWindowResize(edges)`\n- `windowMoveAttempted(started)`\n- `windowResizeAttempted(edges, started)`\n",
      "items": [
        {
